// Report §8.4: the constructors of the desk's AskedMsg at another type, at
// which foreign code on the desk gives back the address of a process of the
// desk's that crossed at AskedMsg. The address is held foreign, behind the
// check in front of that process, and every message of this type passes
// that check.

export type Msg = Note(Int) | Crash(Reply(Int)) | Stall(Reply(Int))
